Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := ካዝና አዲስ: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault መስጥር: message ቁልፍ: key.
>> decrypted := vault ምስጢር-ፍታ: encrypted ቁልፍ: key.

ውጤት 
ፃፍ: ['Message:'], አዲስ-መስመር
ፃፍ: message, አዲስ-መስመር
ፃፍ: ['Decrypted:'], አዲስ-መስመር
ፃፍ: decrypted, አዲስ-መስመር.
